flowchart TD
    Read["Validate a row"] --> Known{"Run and case seen?"}
    Read -->|Invalid row| Error["Exit 2, empty stdout"]
    Known -->|No| Accept["Store tuple and first line"]
    Accept --> Count["Add counters once"]
    Known -->|Yes| Same{"Same result tuple?"}
    Same -->|Yes| Skip["Keep counters and first line"]
    Same -->|No| Error
    Count --> End{"End of input?"}
    Skip --> End
    End -->|No| Read
    End -->|Yes| Print["Print report and exit 0"]
